# Exception: a shared debug-only keystore, committed on purpose. Debug builds
# use Android's default alias/password ("androiddebugkey"/"android") and this
# key can never sign a release, so there's no risk in version-controlling it —
# the whole point is that its SHA-1 stays fixed even after a machine wipe
# regenerates ~/.android/debug.keystore. See GOOGLE_SETUP.md.
!keystore/debug.keystore
google-services.json
